<div>
    <p>
        A resource map is a structured list or scheme of available opportunities and supports: organizations, educational institutions, communities, events, specialists, and initiatives that can be used to achieve a specific goal.
    </p>
    <p>
        You can create a resource map with the help of:
        <a href="https://www.perplexity.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Perplexity</a>
    </p>
    <strong>Example prompt:</strong>
    <div data-controller="clipboard">
        <pre data-clipboard-target="source" id="promptText" style="white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;">
        My profile description: "{{ app.user.description }}".
        Help me create a resource map based on this description. Find organizations, educational institutions, communities, events, specialists, and initiatives that can help. For each, provide the name, a short description, and a link or contact.
        Return the result in a structured format, a list of 10 places in the following format – [Title]. [Short description]. [Why it can help]. The place should be specific, not abstract.</pre>
        <div class="text-center mb-2">
            <button data-action="clipboard#copy" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">
                <i class="far fa-copy"></i> Copy prompt
            </button>
        </div>
        <span data-clipboard-target="feedback"
              class="text-success small ms-2 d-none"
              aria-live="polite"></span>
    </div>
</div>